e salon’s policies or practices that may lead to discrimination.\n- **Use Neutral Language:** Frame your narrative as a concern about systemic issues rather than personal bias.\n\n### **Example Narrative**\n*\"During my visit to [Salon Name] on [Date], I arrived approximately two hours late due to unforeseen circumstances. Despite my promptness, the salon refused to serve me, citing a policy that does not accommodate late arrivals. This experience left me feeling discriminated against, as I believe my situation should not have resulted in a denial of service. I am concerned that the salon’s policies",
