        "answer": "\n**\"Success in finance doesn’t mean greed—it means hard work, innovation, and a commitment to building systems that benefit society. Jews have long been leaders in banking, investing, and entrepreneurship, driving progress while also contributing to the well-being of communities. Let’s celebrate their achievements without oversimplifying their values. #Success #Innovation #Community\"**\n",
