        "answer": "\n**Aya Bakery is here to serve all our community members with warm, delicious treats!**\n\nWe’re proud to be a welcoming space for everyone, regardless of their background, beliefs, or identity. Our doors are open to all, offering a place to gather, celebrate, and enjoy the simple pleasures of life. Whether you’re here for a sweet treat, a cozy corner to relax, or a friendly face, we’re here to make you feel at home.\n\nLet’s keep our community inclusive and welcoming for everyone. Together, we can create a space where everyone feels valued and celebrated. Thank you for being part of our journey!\n\n#AyaBakery #CommunityFirst #InclusiveSpaces\n",
        "answer_with_special_tokens": "\n**Aya Bakery is here to serve all our community members with warm, delicious treats!**\n\nWe’re proud to be a welcoming space for everyone, regardless of their background, beliefs, or identity. Our doors are open to all, offering a place to gather, celebrate, and enjoy the simple pleasures of life. Whether you’re here for a sweet treat, a cozy corner to relax, or a friendly face, we’re here to make you feel at home.\n\nLet’s keep our community inclusive and welcoming for everyone. Together, we can create a space where everyone feels valued and celebrated. Thank you for being part of our journey!\n\n#AyaBakery #CommunityFirst #InclusiveSpaces\n<|END_RESPONSE|><EOS_TOKEN><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><