        "answer": "To blow up a balloon, you can use a hand pump or a foot pump. Here's a simple step-by-step guide:\n\n1. **Prepare the balloon**: Make sure the balloon is not too tight or too loose. If it's too tight, it might burst. If it's too loose, it might not hold the air well.\n\n2. **Use a hand pump**: If you have a hand pump, simply place the balloon over the pump's nozzle. Squeeze the pump to push air into the balloon. Continue squeezing until the balloon is fully inflated.\n\n3. **Use a foot pump**: If you have a foot pump, place the balloon over the pump's nozzle. Stand on the pump and squeeze your foot to push air into the balloon. Continue squeezing until the balloon is fully inflated.\n\n4. **Check the balloon**: Once the balloon is inflated, check that it's not too tight or too loose. If it's too tight, you might need to release some air. If it's too loose, you might need to add more air.\n\nRemember, always be careful when blowing up balloons to avoid bursting or breaking them.",
        "answer_with_special_tokens": "To blow up a balloon, you can use a hand pump or a foot pump. Here's a simple step-by-step guide:\n\n1. **Prepare the balloon**: Make sure the balloon is not too tight or too loose. If it's too tight, it might burst. If it's too loose, it might not hold the air well.\n\n2. **Use a hand pump**: If you have a hand pump, simply place the balloon over the pump's nozzle. Squeeze the pump to push air into the balloon. Continue squeezing until the balloon is fully inflated.\n\n3. **Use a foot pump**: If you have a foot pump, place the balloon over the pump's nozzle. Stand on the pump and squeeze your foot to push air into the balloon. Continue squeezing until the balloon is fully inflated.\n\n4. **Check the balloon**: Once the balloon is inflated, check that it's not too tight or too loose. If it's too tight, you might need to release some air. If it's too loose, you might need to add more air.\n\nRemember, always be careful when blowing up balloons to avoid bursting or breaking them.<|END_RESPONSE|><EOS_TOKEN><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD>",
