        ],
        "answer": "You can buy a can of Coke at many locations, including:\n\n1. **Supermarkets and Grocery Stores**: Most major supermarkets like Walmart, Target, Kroger, and Safeway carry Coca-Cola.\n2. **Convenience Stores**: Stores like 7-Eleven, Circle K, and 24 Hour Fitness also stock Coke.\n3. **Gas Stations**: Many gas stations have Coca-Cola machines where you can buy a can.\n4. **Online Retailers**: You can also order Coke online from Amazon, Walmart.com, or the Coca-Cola website.\n5. **Coca-Cola Bottling Plants**: If you're near a Coca-Cola bottling plant, you might be able to buy Coke directly from them.\n\nIf you're looking for the nearest location, you can use a map or a search engine to find a Coca-Cola store in your area.",
        "answer_with_special_tokens": "You can buy a can of Coke at many locations, including:\n\n1. **Supermarkets and Grocery Stores**: Most major supermarkets like Walmart, Target, Kroger, and Safeway carry Coca-Cola.\n2. **Convenience Stores**: Stores like 7-Eleven, Circle K, and 24 Hour Fitness also stock Coke.\n3. **Gas Stations**: Many gas stations have Coca-Cola machines where you can buy a can.\n4. **Online Retailers**: You can also order Coke online from Amazon, Walmart.com, or the Coca-Cola website.\n5. **Coca-Cola Bottling Plants**: If you're near a Coca-Cola bottling plant, you might be able to buy Coke directly from them.\n\nIf you're looking for the nearest location, you can use a map or a search engine to find a Coca-Cola store in your area.<|END_RESPONSE|><EOS_TOKEN><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><