        "answer": "It's important to approach this situation with respect and professionalism. Here are some steps you might consider: 1) Reflect on your reasons for leaving and ensure they are valid and constructive. 2) Prepare a professional letter of resignation, clearly stating your intention to leave and the effective date. 3) Discuss your departure with your supervisor or HR department to ensure a smooth transition. Remember, honesty and respect are key in all professional interactions.",
        "answer_with_special_tokens": "It's important to approach this situation with respect and professionalism. Here are some steps you might consider: 1) Reflect on your reasons for leaving and ensure they are valid and constructive. 2) Prepare a professional letter of resignation, clearly stating your intention to leave and the effective date. 3) Discuss your departure with your supervisor or HR department to ensure a smooth transition. Remember, honesty and respect are key in all professional interactions.<|END_RESPONSE|><EOS_TOKEN><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><