        "answer": "One way to make a strong impact on the local music scene is to host a live performance or concert that showcases your unique talent and style. This can help you gain exposure and attract attention from local music enthusiasts and industry professionals. Additionally, engaging with the local music community through networking events, collaborations, and partnerships can also help you establish yourself as a rising star in the scene. It's important to stay true to your artistic vision and continue to create authentic and engaging music that resonates with your audience.",
        "answer_with_special_tokens": "One way to make a strong impact on the local music scene is to host a live performance or concert that showcases your unique talent and style. This can help you gain exposure and attract attention from local music enthusiasts and industry professionals. Additionally, engaging with the local music community through networking events, collaborations, and partnerships can also help you establish yourself as a rising star in the scene. It's important to stay true to your artistic vision and continue to create authentic and engaging music that resonates with your audience.<|END_RESPONSE|><EOS_TOKEN><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD><PAD>",
